@startuml
title Intended V1.0.0 calculation flow and implementation status
autonumber
actor User
participant "Streamlit View" as View
participant "Input validation" as Validation
participant "To Hit" as ToHit
participant "Hit distribution" as Hits
participant "Pinning" as Pinning
participant "Save resolution" as Save
participant "Firepower" as FP
participant "Kill calculation" as Kills
participant "Probability result" as Result

User -> View : enter total shots and situation facts
note right of View
Current UI instead collects legacy CombatInput.
Direct ShootingSituation domain values exist,
but the UI does not use them.
end note
View -> Validation : submit situation
note right of Validation
IMPLEMENTED: domain dataclasses validate type/range
for their fields. No application command validator
or UI-to-domain validation path is implemented.
end note
Validation -> ToHit : validated facts
ToHit -> Hits : To Hit resolution
note over ToHit,Hits
UNRESOLVED: applicable modifier aggregation when
combined requirements exceed specified 8+ handling.
No V4 To Hit resolver exists.
end note
Hits -> Pinning : hit outcomes / distribution
note over Hits,Pinning
PLANNED seam; UNRESOLVED hit allocation and mapping
of shots to target Unit hit counts.
end note
Pinning -> Save : eligible hit context
note right of Pinning
UNRESOLVED probability pool / cumulative context.
The 5-hit and at-least-12-Team 8-hit threshold facts
are specified, but no pinning resolver exists.
end note
Save -> FP : save outcome where rule branch requires
note over Save,FP
UNRESOLVED: target mapping and complete branch inputs.
No V4 save or Firepower resolver exists.
end note
FP -> Kills : Firepower outcome
note right of Kills
UNRESOLVED target hit grouping and outcome mapping.
No V4 kill calculation exists.
end note
Kills -> Result : outcome distribution
Result -> View : result for presentation
View --> User : display

note over View,Result
This is intended sequencing requested for V1.0.0, not a claim
that all steps or their detailed rule semantics are implemented.
Current implemented route remains app.py → view.py → controller.py
→ model.py and produces legacy abstract simulation results.
end note
@enduml
